cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "mass-gap-horizonless: code and data for a horizonless branch in the mass gap and its gravitational-wave signatures"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for the paper "A horizonless branch in the mass gap and
  its gravitational-wave signatures". Contains the curvature-tower mechanism and
  its cap, the mini-theorem on the impossibility of a degenerate inner horizon in
  the tower, the horizonlessness criterion and the threshold mass range, echoes
  and time delays, the tidal deformability, the validated f-mode computation, the
  baryon budget, and the quasinormal-mode results.
type: software
